                                                "sense_id": "749cb309-1f9d-3d50-807f-63312b2caaf0",
                                                "text": "Jones had no sooner quitted the room, than the petty-fogger, in a whispering tone, asked Mrs Whitefield, “If she knew who that fine spark was?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "297cc3e4-ef8d-4a6e-87eb-568e2e5fe5c5",
                                                "sense_id": "749cb309-1f9d-3d50-807f-63312b2caaf0",
                                                "text": "He will retrieve his errors yet—their worthy Father, once my honour'd master, was at his years nearly as wild a spark."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
